{"3187560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Freeline!", "steam_appid": 3187560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeline is a frenetic, kinetic, expressive speedrunning platformer about taking down the surveillance state and reclaiming the rooftops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts, optimise routes, and break the limits of an incredibly dynamic platforming moveset in this breakneck mission to take down big tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeline is all about finding your own path. You're equipped with a ridiculously versatile moveset of jumps, flips, slides, and swings that turns the city into your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is built to be replayed. Find better routes, take hidden shortcuts, and exploit crazy tech to shoot to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/c7f1cdb36eb66ce2c43e04bffcc7604a.poster.avif?t=1781114743\" width=720 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/c7f1cdb36eb66ce2c43e04bffcc7604a.webm?t=1781114743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/c7f1cdb36eb66ce2c43e04bffcc7604a.mp4?t=1781114743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in a corporate-owned megacity, privacy is at a premium. Camera networks track your every move at street-level, so a small band of freerunners take to the rooftops to avoid the prying eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Corrin, a young, headstrong parkour enthusiast with two strikes on his record. Do you have what it takes to save parkour?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/a252b915cb52a62c4411379f5d79bc12.poster.avif?t=1781114743\" width=720 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/a252b915cb52a62c4411379f5d79bc12.webm?t=1781114743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/a252b915cb52a62c4411379f5d79bc12.mp4?t=1781114743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeline is a frenetic, kinetic, expressive speedrunning platformer about taking down the surveillance state and reclaiming the rooftops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts, optimise routes, and break the limits of an incredibly dynamic platforming moveset in this breakneck mission to take down big tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeline is all about finding your own path. You're equipped with a ridiculously versatile moveset of jumps, flips, slides, and swings that turns the city into your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is built to be replayed. Find better routes, take hidden shortcuts, and exploit crazy tech to shoot to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187560/extras/c7f1cdb36eb66ce2c43e04bffcc7604a.poster.avif?t=1781114743\" width=720 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akama